  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaGivesBirth.ThereAsExpectedBoulder": "[pg]There, as you expected, you find the bovine braud leaning against a convenient boulder, stripped naked and with one hand wrapped around her distended midriff. She sees you and manages to give you a weak smile, but doesn't bother trying to speak. Instead, she lets out a very bovine bellow as another contraction hits. You promptly move to support her, standing behind her and reaching around her as best you can to cuddle and rub and support her overstuffed womb and the frantically wriggling baby doing its level best to leave it."
