  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaSparMenu.AsksVhatStakesAccent": "Isabella asks, [say: Vhat stakes should ve use? Vould you rather we spar light or fight like ze creatures of zis world?]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaSparMenu.GoodForBothAccent": "Zis vill be good for both of us, ya!?[sayend] The beaming cow-girl taps a finger to her chin and suggests, [say: Ve should set up out on ze edges of the plains, so ve don't damage zis camp.]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaSparMenu.GoodForBothPlain": "This ought to be good for both of us![sayend] The beaming cow-girl taps a finger to her chin and suggests, [say: Why don't we set up a faux camp on the edge of the plains, so we don't damage this one. Okay?]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaSparMenu.HowShouldWeFight": "Isabella asks, [say: How should we fight? Would you rather we spar light or fight like the creatures of this world?]"
