  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaTakesOviElixir.OfferAnotherBottle": "You offer Isabella another bottle of the pregnancy-shortening elixir, and she looks at it as she takes it in her hand. [say: Again?] she asks. You'd like to see your baby sooner rather than later. [say: Mm,] she replies, perhaps in two minds about seeing her baby sooner versus a longer and more natural pregnancy. Nevertheless, she chugs the fluid down without issue."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaTakesOviElixir.OfferBottleQuickenDevelopment": "You offer Isabella a bottle of ovi elixir, mentioning it will quicken the development of the baby. Hesitation covers her face. [if (isabellaAccent) {[say: Is zis okay? Izabella does not want to mutate child...]|[say: Is this okay? I don't want to mutate our child...]}] As you understand it, the elixir is safe, and you assure her as much. The bovine holds the bottle still for a few moments before accepting and drinking it in a single chug. She's still human, fundamentally, so you're not sure how much time you really shaved off."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaTakesOviElixir.TakeBottleHand": "You take a bottle of ovi elixir from your [pouch] and hand it to Isabella. She accepts it and takes a single mighty swig, emptying the contents immediately. The bovine rubs her belly contently, perhaps feeling the growth spurt happen."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaTalkMenu.DebugLabel": "[pg]<b><u>DEBUG:</u></b>"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaTalkMenu.TypeAgeDay": "\nType: {0}; Age: {1} day{2}"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaTalkMenu.WhatToDiscuss": "What would you like to discuss with Isabella?"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaTalksAboutPotentialPregnancy.AskWhySurprised": "[pg]You look at her in surprise and ask why she is asking you that. Isabella retains her nervous expression, before awkwardly beginning, [say: I... [w]ell, I al[w]ays thought that, one day, I [w]ould have a family, but first I had to find a man who [w]as [w]orthy, and [th]en [th]ere [w]as [th]e adventuring and... [w]ell, I never had [th]e chance before I ended up in [th]is [w]orld. But, now [th]at I have you... I understand [th]at [th]ere are many reasons not to, but, if you do [w]ant to start a family [w]ith me, I am [w]illing. Okay? I just [w]anted to tell you [th]at, and for you to remember[if (!isabellaAccent) { that}].]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaTalksAboutPotentialPregnancy.BeatsHastyRetreat": "[pg]That said and done, the bovine warrior beats a hasty retreat, allowing you to get to bed. Admittedly, with something to think over while you sleep."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaTalksAboutPotentialPregnancy.HeadForNoticeIsabella": "[pg]As you head for your {0}, looking forward to the end of another long day, you notice Isabella approaching, seeming strangely nervous for the bovine warrior-woman. You call out to her in greeting, asking if something is the matter."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaTalksAboutPotentialPregnancy.HopedToSeeYou": "[pg][say: Ah, [name], I [w]as hoping to see you,] she replies. Nervously looking at the ground, pawing at the dry earth with one cloven hoof, she suddenly blurts out, [say: [w]hat do you think of children, [name]?]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellaTalksAboutPotentialPregnancy.TalkContraceptives": "[pg]<b>You can now talk to Isabella about whether she should be on contraceptives or not.</b>"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.CantFocusAtAll": "No matter what you do, you can't get the normally-industrious cow-girl to focus right now. She's obviously bored with your attempts to teach her, and she spends the entire lesson trying to tease you with her body. It's more effective than you care to admit"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.CatchesOwnMistakes": "[pg][b:Isabella has made enough progress that if she thinks about it, she will sometimes catch her mistakes on her own.]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.GainedControlSpeakProperly": "[pg][b:Isabella has gained enough control over her language to speak properly... if she talks about half as fast as normal.]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.GettingBetterAtLessons": "[pg][b:Isabella is getting better during your lessons. Generally she can pick out most of her mistakes if she pauses to think over what she just said.]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.HourOfDiction": "You spend an hour going over Isabella's language and diction with her. She seems to make a little progress with it, which makes her happy, but you feel that in the grand scheme of things, she could do better."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.HourTeachingProperlyFlustered": "You spend an hour trying to teach Isabella how to speak properly. While she is often flustered by her mistakes, she makes notable improvements from this session. By the time you two finish, she seems quite pleased with herself."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.LeaveLessonStiffness": ", and you leave the lesson with certain stiffness in your loins."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.LeaveLessonWetPanties": ", and you leave the lesson with wet panties."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.NoProgressAtAll": "In spite of your efforts to teach the foreign cow-girl, she doesn't seem to make any progress. The worst part is, she keeps slumping down when you correct her, which only sets her bosom to jiggling, her cleavage looking larger than ever before. You wind up quite distracted by the time the two of you get finished."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.OfferLessonsReduceAccent": "You tell Isabella you'd like to offer her lessons in order to reduce her accent and make her more understandable. She folds her arms across her chest and protests, [say: You have an accent too, nein?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.ProudlyLearnedEverything": "[pg]Isabella proudly says, [say: I think I've learned everything you have to teach, [name].] You smile at the progress she's made and applaud. [b:There's little else you can teach her.]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.ReduceHerAccent": "You go over Isabella's word choice with her in an effort to reduce her accent. In short order, the cow-girl is looking at you with rapt, attentive eyes, hanging on to your every word as you help her disguise her tongue to match those she's surrounded by."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.SentencePeriod": "."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.ShakesHeadNein": "Isabella shakes her head and says, [say: Nein. I do not vish to spend time on zis now.]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.SpeaksWithoutAccent": "[pg][b:Isabella can often speak without her accent when she tries to, though she doesn't seem to be doing so in everyday conversation yet. She's so close though!]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.SpendHourLittleProgress": "You spend an hour speaking with Isabella, but ultimately, you wind up making little, if any, progress. The cow-girl seems a bit dispirited at the failure, but she gives you a big hug anyway."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.TwoSentencesNoMistake": "[pg][b:Isabella will sometimes manage to say a sentence or two without a single mistake during the lessons. It's good progress!]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.WordChoiceCorrect": "You go over Isabella's word choice with her and try to correct her whenever she uses the wrong word or slips into her native tongue. She seems to make a modicum of progress, yet the downward cast of her eyes shows just how much better she feels she could have done."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.IsabellasAccentCoaching.WordChoiceCorrectAgain": "You go over Isabella's word choice with her and try to correct her whenever she uses the wrong word or slips into her native tongue. It takes some time, but you're happy to tell Isabella that she seems to be making significant progress."
