  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellaContraceptives.EnjoyHugWriggleFree": "[pg]You just smile at her, enjoy the hug for several moments, then politely wriggle free and excuse yourself."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellaContraceptives.NoLongerPregnant": "[pg]<b>(Isabella can no longer get pregnant.)</b>"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellaContraceptives.NodsReasonablyJaHard": "[pg]The cow-girl nods her head reasonably. [saystart]Ja, [th]is makes sense. It is a hard life [w]e live out here; the times[if (isabellaAccent) {, they}] are too dangerous to reasonably expect you to look after a pregnant [w]oman and then a little baby, [if (isabellaAccent) {ja|yes}]?"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellaContraceptives.OnesToLookAfter": " Besides, [w]e have {0} small {1} to look after already."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellaContraceptives.SayEnd": "[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellaContraceptives.SmallNotEnough": "[pg]She grins at you wickedly. [say: {0} small {1} [w]as not enough, hmm? You [if (isabellaAccent) {{are vanting|want}}] more?]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellaContraceptives.StillWantYou": "[pg]Isabella's face lights up. [say: Of course I still want you, silly [manboy].] She grabs you in a fierce hug, squeezing you into her breasts so hard that you can feel milk seeping from her eight nipples{0}."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellaContraceptives.TellBestStartContraceptives": "You tell Isabella that you think maybe it's best if she starts taking her contraceptives again."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellaContraceptives.TellStillWantsFamily": "You tell Isabella that, if she still wants to have a family with you, you would like to be the father of her children."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellaContraceptives.ThankUnderstandingHeadBack": "[pg]You thank her for understanding, and then head back to the main part of the camp."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellasMorningWoodChopping.BattlingDemonsUnsated": "Of course; [w]e [w]ouldn't [w]ant you to be out [th]ere battling demons unsated. Who knows [w]hat [w]ould happen?"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellasMorningWoodChopping.BlushAnd": "blush and "
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellasMorningWoodChopping.ChangeMind": "Just let me know if you change your mind, all right?[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellasMorningWoodChopping.ChangeMindAccent": "Just let Isabella know if you change your mind, ja?[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellasMorningWoodChopping.ManageWoodMyself": "You let Isabella know that you'd rather manage your morning wood yourself, and if possible, save up your cum rather than having her drain it every morning. She looks a little disappointed but agrees to leave you be in the morning. Before you go, she offers, [saystart]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellasMorningWoodChopping.OnlyOnceYouShrink": "I [w]ill, but only once you shrink [th]at monster down. I [if (isabellaAccent) {cannot handle somezing|can't handle something}] like [th]at!"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellasMorningWoodChopping.SayEnd": "[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellasMorningWoodChopping.SmirkAnd": "smirk and "
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellasMorningWoodChopping.StillInterested": "let Isabella know that if she's still interested, you'd like her to suck you off in the mornings again. Her face colors, but you see her eight nipple-tips poking hard at her silk shirt as she answers, [saystart]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.ToggleIsabellasMorningWoodChopping.You": "You "
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.TurnDownIsabellaFollower.PushBackFrustration": "You push back from Isabella's smothering embrace with a little bit of frustration. As soon as she realizes what's going on, the heavy-breasted woman's cheeks color in embarrassment and she retreats to her shield, her hands kneading the hard metal edge nervously. You inform her that it would be best she remain here for now, at least until you've succeeded in your mission and brought peace to this strange place.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.TurnDownIsabellaFollower.SighsSlumpsAgainstShield": "Isabella sighs and slumps down against her metal defender at your words. Eventually, she answers, [say: I... understand, [name]. I shall continue mein lonely vigil. Vas zere somezing else I could do for you, ja?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.YesToIsabellaTF.AdmitsTakesShard": "[pg][say: ...I had not thought of that.] Isabella admits. She then {0}takes the shard of crystallized soul-stuff in one hand, gently dropping the blankets to the ground next to her hoof. She wraps her other hand around it and closes her eyes, looking like she is praying, before starting to gently murmur to herself. You realize that what she's speaking must be her own language; it expands upon her normal accent and thickens it until you cannot understand a word she is saying. You idly wonder if maybe she can teach it to you before you are interrupted by a blinding flash of light. When you can see again, Isabella is blinking her own vision back and opens her hands, revealing nothing."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.YesToIsabellaTF.AfterMuchThought": "You tell Isabella that, after much consideration, you think she should use the lethicite on herself. After all, didn't her transformations make her bigger and stronger than any normal human? While you do seek to topple the lord of the demons, you doubt that will make them all just vanish into the wind, so passing that strength on to her children would be the kindest thing to do."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.YesToIsabellaTF.AgreeSuggestLieDown": "[pg]You agree with her, and suggest she have a lie down; that must have drained her, after all. Isabella looks a little skeptical, but evidently figures that a bit of rest is well-deserved, so she just nods and, awkwardly reclaiming the blanket, heads off to have a nap, leaving you to go away."
  "Scenes.Isabellafollowerscene.YesToIsabellaTF.DeclaresCrookedSmile": "[pg][say: Well... I guess that is that,] she declares, giving you a crooked smile. [say: I suppose we will not know if it worked until this little one comes out to say hello.] She notes, rubbing her swollen midriff."
}
